    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">RMB301 · Chapter 4 · Session 6 · assessment / review</span>\n<h2>Session 6 — Chapter 3: Critically reviewing the literature (cont.)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 12391 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">RMB301 · Chương 4 · Buổi 6 · kiểm tra / ôn tập</span>\n<h2>Buổi 6 — Chapter 3: Critically reviewing the literature (cont.)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 12391 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">LO1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">TU</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">LO1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">TU</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Chapter 3: Critically reviewing the literature (cont.)</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>Text book Chapter 3<br><br>Slide Chapter 3</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>Read text book Chapter 3<br><br>Read slide Chapter 3<br><br>Do practice and assignment</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Constructive questions — answer them yourself first</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Câu hỏi kiến tạo — tự trả lời trước</h3></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>ĐN1</strong> — Search from secondary sources at least five relavant reports which relate to your topic</li>\n<li><strong>ĐN2</strong> — Together with your colleagues, decide on the extent to which a set of research ideas constitute a 'good research topic' according to the checklist in Box 2.2.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Practise in the <a href=\"/exam?course=RMB301\">Exam Room — RMB301</a> (3 practice papers: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Luyện tại <a href=\"/exam?course=RMB301\">Phòng thi — RMB301</a> (3 đề luyện: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
